==English==
{{wikipedia|Mangan (surname)}}

===Etymology===
Reduced Anglicized form of {{der|en|ga|Ó Mongáin||descendant of Mongán}}, a personal name derived from a diminutive form of {{m|ga|mongach||maned, long-haired}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|s}}

# {{surname|en|from=Irish}}.

====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Mangan'' is the 5508<sup>th</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 6315 individuals. ''Mangan'' is most common among White (90.31%) individuals.

